    gmeow:sliceConsumer "The foundational WEMI 4-tier spine (Work/Expression/Manifestation/Item) plus the universal Contribution and CreativeDerivation relators, consumed by the documents, software-products, citations, narrative, and music slices; projects to FRBR/LRMoo/CIDOC/schema.org by reference (Principle 5)."@x-gmeow-english.
